OL,3,GNEWSAWhat a spectre - Bond boys bounce
OL,4,Aaround London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hunt for the next James Bond will
OL,7,Freportedly reach its final stages this
OL,8,Fweekend as screen tests for the role
OL,9,Fwill be held in London.
OL,11,FPeople in the capital might be able to
OL,12,Fspot one of the apparent front-runners
OL,13,Fdashing about in a dinner jacket - with
OL,14,FJack Lowden, Callum Turner and Josh
OL,15,FO'Connor shaking, not stirring, their
OL,16,Fway through the three components to the
OL,17,Fscreen tests: stunts, camera presence
OL,18,Fand dialogue.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
