OL,3,GNEWSAWhat a spectre - Bond boys bounce
OL,4,Aaround London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe actor chosen will replace Daniel
OL,7,FCraig, who took over the role of the
OL,8,Fspy/well-dressed killer with Casino
OL,9,FRoyale in 2006.
OL,11,FPerhaps the three actors will be
OL,12,Fnowhere to be seen, so here are a few
OL,13,Fmore sites Bond fans could visit in
OL,14,FLondon. After all, you only live twice.
